     * even when current and sync repairs the currently installed version. Returned is_new, PID and log path report job
     * start/reuse, not completion. The client does not open logs, poll, retry or roll back.
     *
     * API-map identity: whm1:start_cpanel_update#GET (wire name start_cpanel_update; Updates).
     *
     * @param string|null $mode The cPanel & WHM update’s mode of operation. Null omits it.
