     * Documented: Changes a linked remote node using a root-level token and username; omitted token, hostname and
     * username retain their stored values. hostname does not accept an IP address. Omitted skipTlsVerification retains
     * the documented true default, unlike the false defaults for linking/status; explicit false sends 0. A TLS-verified
     * remote server cannot skip verification.
     *
     * API-map identity: whm1:update_linked_server_node#GET (wire name update_linked_server_node; Server Nodes).
